    "title": "Florida Apartment Association",
    "description": "*** FOR MEETING ATTENDEES ONLY *** \r\n\r\nThe Florida Apartment Association mobile application allows you to view abstracts, presentations, speakers, and exhibitors from Florida Apartment Association events. Users can take notes adjacent available presentation slides and draw directly on slides inside the app. Note-taking is also available in the exhibitor module. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, users can share information with attendees and colleagues with in app messaging, tweeting and emailing.",
